graph TD
    %% 定义样式
    classDef core fill:#f9f,stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef memory fill:#ff9,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef network fill:#bbf,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef wireless fill:#bfb,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px;
    classDef interface fill:#ddd,stroke:#333,stroke-width:1px,stroke-dasharray: 5 5;

    subgraph 核心处理与存储
        CPU[CPU: AN7563PT<br>双核A53 1.0GHz]:::core
        RAM[内存: A3T4GF40BBF-HP<br>512MB DDR3 1866]:::memory
        Flash[闪存: GD5F1GM7UEYIG<br>128MB]:::memory
    end

    subgraph 无线射频部分
        MACBB[基带&MAC芯片<br>MT7991B]:::wireless
        RF5G[射频芯片<br>MT7976CN]:::wireless
        
        Antenna(5根外置天线):::interface
    end
    
    subgraph 外围接口
        Ports1G(4个 千兆网口):::interface
    end

    %% 连接关系 - 存储
    CPU <--> RAM
    CPU <--> Flash
    
    %% 连接关系 - 有线网络
    CPU <-->|内置| Ports1G
    
    %% 连接关系 - 无线射频
    CPU <-->|PCIe 2.0 x1<br>4Gbps| MACBB
    MACBB <--> RF5G
    RF5G <--> Antenna
